;Fist of Retribution: Project Zero - MPC Headquarters (Faye's stage)
;The main lobby of MPC Headquarters at night, where Faye drops from the air vent to fight Viktor Svenson.
;Painted in ChatGPT in the style of Club Flow; the lights are made by stage_faye/build_stage.py.
